#!/usr/bin/python3
"""Deterministic, fail-closed deployment worker for the local control plane.

The broker-facing dispatcher starts this program only through one of two fixed
systemd units.  This worker never accepts a path, command, provider key, token,
or other free-form value from the broker.  It snapshots an allowlisted source
tree, verifies the release and Atlas RPM digests, records the previous state,
then installs and activates the reviewed components in a fixed order.

No OpenBao value is read here.  Services consume only their existing encrypted
AppRole references.  The one bootstrap input (the Zulip owner password) is a
root-only file in /run; it is passed as a file reference and removed in a
finally block without ever being copied into a backup or result document.
"""

